/E (The proposed system is an online voting platform designed to automate and secure the entire college election process. It provides user authentication, digital voter roll management, online candidate registration, and a secure electronic voting mechanism. Votes are encrypted, stored in a database, and counted automatically, eliminating manual errors. The system generates real- time results and detailed audit reports, ensuring transparency and reliability. This approach reduces administrative effort, improves participation, and offers a scalable and cost-effective solution for conducting fair and tamper-proof college elections. )
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [14]
