748 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 231 0 R
/E (Through this project, we implemented key features such as secure user authentication, onevote-per-student enforcement, candidate management, real-time result generation, and email notifications to the concerned authorities. The use of Python \(Flask\) for the backend, a relational database for storing votes and user details, and a simple, user-friendly web interface made the system reliable and scalable for future elections. )
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
749 0 obj
<<
