/P 231 0 R
/E (The College Election Online Voting System was successfully designed, developed, and implemented to provide a secure, transparent, and efficient platform for conducting student elections. The system addressed the limitations of manual election processes, such as time consumption, errors in counting, and lack of immediate results. )
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [5]
>>
